WEBVTT

00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:33.570
How do you feel?

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:34.770
Incredible!

00:01:40.810 --> 00:01:41.980
This is it for you!

00:01:43.330 --> 00:01:44.490
You're wrong!

00:01:44.890 --> 00:01:48.640
Shut up! Don't order me around!

00:01:53.640 --> 00:01:55.130
Open your eyes, Nick!

00:01:55.390 --> 00:01:57.140
Lina, stand back!

00:02:04.230 --> 00:02:04.730
Will!

00:02:05.380 --> 00:02:06.740
This is your fault!

00:02:07.670 --> 00:02:09.440
This is all your fault!

00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:10.750
Nick!

00:02:11.260 --> 00:02:12.190
Nick!

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:17.330
I'm free! I'm free!!

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:43.480
<i>Joey, Joey!</i>

00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:45.650
<i>Respond, Joey!</i>

00:02:48.580 --> 00:02:49.440
<i>Joey!</i>

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:50.470
<i>What happened?</i>

00:02:51.450 --> 00:02:52.290
<i>Answer me!</i>

00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:53.940
<i>Joey!</i>

00:02:54.880 --> 00:02:56.200
<i>Joey!!</i>

00:02:58.530 --> 00:02:59.300
What's going on?

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:01.450
I don't know.

00:03:01.930 --> 00:03:06.780
All I'm sure of is that Joey isn't able 
to use his walkie-talkie right now.

00:03:22.570 --> 00:03:27.030
The sphere is currently moving in a 
straight line at 25 miles per hour.

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:29.430
<i>The evacuations of the 
residents are mostly complete,</i>

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:32.840
Aliens? That's like something 
out of a comic book.

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:34.030
<i>but nothing is left in the wake of 
the sphere's path of destruction!</i>

00:03:34.030 --> 00:03:36.580
I can't believe they'd really 
show up in front of us like this.

00:03:36.580 --> 00:03:37.730
No complaining.

00:03:38.130 --> 00:03:41.180
It's not like it has anything 
to do with us, anyway.

00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:43.240
Oh, I wouldn't be so sure.

00:03:44.010 --> 00:03:45.100
D-Doctor!

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:46.240
You're back?

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:48.570
And wait, what do you mean?

00:03:48.570 --> 00:03:53.200
You see... We're going to stop that sphere!

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:56.510
Something that big?

00:03:56.850 --> 00:03:57.820
But, how?

00:03:59.140 --> 00:04:00.550
I have a plan.

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:05.560
But my true aim is the alien's technology!

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:09.510
We are heading out in 30 minutes.

00:04:10.440 --> 00:04:13.000
We are scheduled to arrive in 3 hours.

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:17.180
The mission is scheduled to 
start in 3 hours and 20 minutes.

00:04:19.080 --> 00:04:20.720
You heard her!

00:04:20.890 --> 00:04:23.930
Now, begin the preparations, comrades!

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:33.060
This way.

00:04:33.780 --> 00:04:35.400
I think that's the entrance over there.

00:04:35.940 --> 00:04:38.960
Thanks to Joey, it doesn't look like 
there's anyone to get in our way.

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:40.490
Joey...

00:04:41.270 --> 00:04:42.080
Don't worry!

00:04:42.620 --> 00:04:44.980
We're going to accomplish our mission.

00:04:45.440 --> 00:04:46.210
Got it!

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:02.130
Report.

00:05:02.950 --> 00:05:06.590
The area we attacked has 
been completely destroyed.

00:05:07.230 --> 00:05:10.630
I can't believe something that
small would put an end to them.

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:12.580
Intruders detected!

00:05:13.740 --> 00:05:14.940
The white one?

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:18.390
No... Well, he's white, 
but it's a different one.

00:05:18.890 --> 00:05:19.790
Two humans.

00:05:20.280 --> 00:05:20.940
Beginning attack.

00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:30.890
Damn it! Why'd they discover us all of a sudden?

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:35.140
They must have some kind of 
high-tech security system!

00:05:35.800 --> 00:05:36.860
Really?

00:05:37.360 --> 00:05:40.250
'Cause I think it's that white coat of yours!

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:46.460
Let's put the matter of 
my attire aside for now.

00:05:48.100 --> 00:05:49.290
Anyway...

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:54.200
What's crucial here is getting 
out of this sticky situation.

00:05:54.630 --> 00:05:57.330
Yes. Please do tell me your thoughts on that.

00:05:57.910 --> 00:06:00.830
I can use this to slow 'em 
down, but it can't beat 'em!

00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:04.520
Oh, I accounted for that.

00:06:04.810 --> 00:06:05.400
With this.

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:11.890
Psy, here we go!

00:06:12.540 --> 00:06:13.290
Okay!

00:06:31.480 --> 00:06:32.330
Wow!

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:34.950
So this went according to plan, too?

00:06:35.440 --> 00:06:37.700
Yup! First we stop the enemy in their tracks...

00:06:38.610 --> 00:06:39.750
...and run away while we have the chance!

00:06:41.550 --> 00:06:43.320
So that's your plan after all?

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:08.750
Thanks.

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:11.740
Lina! Will!

00:07:23.850 --> 00:07:25.550
Lina! Will!

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:38.260
Nick...

00:07:45.780 --> 00:07:47.250
Heroman, over here!

00:07:54.340 --> 00:07:54.950
Lina!

00:07:55.840 --> 00:07:56.200
Will!

00:07:57.450 --> 00:07:59.240
J-Joey?

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:00.800
You okay?

00:08:01.630 --> 00:08:03.380
Yeah... Fine.

00:08:03.990 --> 00:08:05.060
Lina's fine...

00:08:05.900 --> 00:08:06.560
Will!

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:10.760
Brother?

00:08:11.460 --> 00:08:12.090
Joey!

00:08:13.330 --> 00:08:13.940
Lina...

00:08:17.820 --> 00:08:18.850
Brother!

00:08:19.340 --> 00:08:19.980
Lina.

00:08:20.970 --> 00:08:23.300
Take Will with you and escape from here.

00:08:23.530 --> 00:08:24.310
What about you, Joey?

00:08:24.880 --> 00:08:26.610
I'm heading toward Psy and the Professor.

00:08:27.010 --> 00:08:28.220
Then I'll go too!

00:08:29.520 --> 00:08:31.360
We can't leave Will behind.

00:08:31.790 --> 00:08:34.490
You need to protect Will now, Lina...

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:38.230
Me, protect my brother?

00:08:49.110 --> 00:08:49.830
We're counting on you.

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:54.070
Okay. I understand.

00:08:58.310 --> 00:09:00.420
You still haven't finished them off?

00:09:01.050 --> 00:09:03.410
They're just two humans!

00:09:03.940 --> 00:09:05.120
We're still attacking.

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:07.620
There is no change in the situation.

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:11.130
Enough!

00:09:12.060 --> 00:09:12.530
Yes, sir?

00:09:13.220 --> 00:09:16.030
I will finish them myself!

00:09:19.470 --> 00:09:20.760
Go!

00:09:23.070 --> 00:09:25.000
Take this! Denton Beam!

00:09:38.530 --> 00:09:39.150
What's that?

00:10:01.070 --> 00:10:02.120
That's...

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:06.370
Just great... Another new face joins the party.

00:10:11.830 --> 00:10:13.940
Attention humans!

00:10:13.940 --> 00:10:18.340
I must teach you what it means to oppose us!

00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:19.640
Here I come!

00:10:40.770 --> 00:10:41.760
Are you seeing this?

00:10:42.180 --> 00:10:43.510
Yeah, I am...

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:45.410
This guy's dangerous.

00:10:46.310 --> 00:10:48.410
Anyway, at times like this...

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:50.560
We run!

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:53.860
There is no escape.

00:11:03.700 --> 00:11:04.320
That's...

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:12.270
It's only a matter of time!

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:14.270
I know Joey will come.

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:15.720
We have to hold out until then!

00:11:18.020 --> 00:11:19.450
Split up!

00:11:19.450 --> 00:11:22.150
When one of us is targeted, 
the other one provides cover!

00:11:23.230 --> 00:11:26.160
Aim to keep 25 meters apart!

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:27.320
Got it!

00:11:31.300 --> 00:11:32.660
You impertinent little...

00:11:39.810 --> 00:11:40.420
Now!

00:11:59.750 --> 00:12:00.440
How'd you like that?

00:12:05.270 --> 00:12:06.300
I see...

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:09.930
You amplified high frequency sound waves,

00:12:09.930 --> 00:12:12.810
in order to temporarily paralyze us.

00:12:13.910 --> 00:12:17.570
But if you actually thought an 
attack like that would defeat <i>me</i>...

00:12:18.460 --> 00:12:19.890
...you would be sorely mistaken!

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:29.390
Show yourself!

00:12:29.740 --> 00:12:31.860
Don't you care about what 
happens to your friend?

00:12:32.760 --> 00:12:33.850
Don't do it, Professor!

00:12:34.460 --> 00:12:36.010
He'll get you, too!

00:12:36.010 --> 00:12:37.100
Silence!

00:12:38.130 --> 00:12:38.750
Psy!

00:12:40.240 --> 00:12:41.150
No matter.

00:12:41.490 --> 00:12:43.100
I'll deal with you first.

00:12:44.590 --> 00:12:46.140
Wait! Please wait!

00:12:52.950 --> 00:12:54.540
I'll take his place!

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:56.460
Release Psy!

00:13:02.780 --> 00:13:04.130
Fool.

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:05.860
You're in no position to negotiate!

00:13:06.120 --> 00:13:08.700
All you have left is death!

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:35.880
J-Joey...

00:13:35.880 --> 00:13:36.610
You okay?

00:13:36.940 --> 00:13:38.170
Yeah, this is nothin'...

00:13:51.900 --> 00:13:53.430
So, you show yourself...

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:55.900
...white one.

00:14:13.340 --> 00:14:15.530
Let me introduce myself!

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:18.000
My name is Kogorr!

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:20.790
And I am the ruler of this planet.

00:14:21.260 --> 00:14:21.870
Why?

00:14:22.910 --> 00:14:24.570
Why are you doing this?

00:14:25.070 --> 00:14:26.620
What do you want from us?

00:14:27.020 --> 00:14:31.140
You didn't just come here to 
fight with humanity, right?

00:14:31.890 --> 00:14:34.500
If your science is so far 
advanced compared to ours,

00:14:34.500 --> 00:14:36.640
you should be able to choose a different path!

00:14:37.150 --> 00:14:40.860
I didn't make contact with you so
that something like this would happen!

00:14:41.260 --> 00:14:43.080
It was for cultural exchange!

00:14:43.390 --> 00:14:45.480
It was to bring peace to this world!

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:47.560
How foolish.

00:14:47.830 --> 00:14:48.280
What?

00:14:49.120 --> 00:14:54.340
You slaughter livestock yourselves, 
and yet you have to ask?

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:57.860
Are you calling us livestock?

00:14:58.160 --> 00:14:59.280
Don't, Psy!

00:14:59.800 --> 00:15:02.280
It seems it's no use no matter what we say.

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:04.560
I'll do it!

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:06.250
Stand back, you two!

00:15:06.970 --> 00:15:08.140
Be careful, Joey!

00:15:08.140 --> 00:15:09.990
He's a whole 'nother level from 
the guys we've faced so far.

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:11.730
Right!

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:14.490
That's right!

00:15:14.490 --> 00:15:17.520
Negotiating won't work with us Skrugg.

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:20.230
You either submit, or die!

00:15:32.120 --> 00:15:33.140
His body...

00:15:56.010 --> 00:15:56.430
Fight me!

00:15:57.230 --> 00:15:58.610
Heroman...

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:01.500
Attack!

00:16:02.970 --> 00:16:04.290
That power...

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:05.780
Show it to me!

00:16:13.550 --> 00:16:14.450
There!

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:16.450
Heroman!

00:16:18.190 --> 00:16:20.100
Heroman took damage!

00:16:20.520 --> 00:16:21.710
I see.

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:23.670
You do have power, yes.

00:16:30.060 --> 00:16:32.210
But... How about your speed?

00:16:40.470 --> 00:16:41.500
Wings?

00:16:41.500 --> 00:16:43.140
I can't believe it, this guy's able to...

00:16:43.680 --> 00:16:45.530
That's right! Believe it!

00:16:56.210 --> 00:16:57.170
Heroman!

00:17:04.020 --> 00:17:04.810
This is bad.

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:05.750
What?

00:17:06.760 --> 00:17:08.900
Well, there's that speed, of course.

00:17:08.900 --> 00:17:12.250
But do you realize what being able 
to fly freely like that means?

00:17:15.570 --> 00:17:18.930
It means he can attack the enemy from above!

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:23.630
And most importantly, Heroman's attacks 
can't reach targets in the air!

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:36.030
There!

00:17:40.650 --> 00:17:41.640
Heroman!

00:17:44.470 --> 00:17:45.190
Oh, no!

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:47.920
Stand up, Heroman!

00:17:48.780 --> 00:17:49.920
Not so fast!

00:17:50.140 --> 00:17:51.320
Die!

00:17:52.360 --> 00:17:53.420
Heroman!

00:17:52.930 --> 00:17:53.780
Heroman!

00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:06.860
Joey!

00:18:06.590 --> 00:18:07.140
Joey!

00:18:09.290 --> 00:18:10.020
If you need speed...

00:18:11.070 --> 00:18:12.120
I'll handle that.

00:18:12.980 --> 00:18:14.310
So... Heroman...

00:18:15.430 --> 00:18:16.300
You'd better...

00:18:16.860 --> 00:18:18.030
...not give up!

00:18:32.830 --> 00:18:35.990
So there's another little 
fellow flitting around...

00:18:35.990 --> 00:18:37.620
That won't change a thing!

00:18:40.040 --> 00:18:41.190
You're mine!

00:19:12.160 --> 00:19:12.920
He's fast...

00:19:15.540 --> 00:19:16.600
Out of my way!

00:19:23.050 --> 00:19:24.510
Excellent, Joey.

00:19:24.510 --> 00:19:28.040
That's the way to fight to compensate 
for Heroman's lack of speed.

00:19:28.290 --> 00:19:30.120
Yeah, no kidding...

00:19:30.120 --> 00:19:33.100
They fight together, compensating 
for each other's weaknesses.

00:19:33.860 --> 00:19:39.130
This is probably the form that Heroman 
and Joey should become in the future!

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:40.650
What's this?

00:19:43.000 --> 00:19:43.960
Stay back!

00:19:46.850 --> 00:19:47.530
What the...

00:19:52.180 --> 00:19:53.420
This guy's fast!

00:19:53.970 --> 00:19:54.370
Now!

00:19:56.930 --> 00:19:57.790
Good one!

00:19:59.790 --> 00:20:01.130
Heroman...

00:20:02.570 --> 00:20:03.410
Blast!

00:20:38.560 --> 00:20:39.530
All right!

00:20:39.530 --> 00:20:40.760
You did it!

00:20:57.600 --> 00:20:59.670
Impressive teamwork.

00:21:00.240 --> 00:21:04.060
There's no way that Kogorr would 
come away unharmed from that hit.

00:21:10.130 --> 00:21:10.870
It's all...

00:21:19.590 --> 00:21:21.090
How dare you!

00:21:21.090 --> 00:21:23.830
<i>You</i>, damage <i>me</i>?

00:21:24.060 --> 00:21:26.030
I will not allow this to pass!

00:21:43.300 --> 00:21:46.210
You let your guard down, boy!

00:22:08.210 --> 00:22:13.350
Joey!!!

00:22:20.690 --> 00:22:24.090
<b>"Can you hear this voice?"</b>

00:22:24.090 --> 00:22:31.560
<b>I've been calling that, always, from deep within my heart.</b>

00:22:34.370 --> 00:22:45.460
<b>Would you, all alone, let another lonely one be next to you?</b>

00:22:45.460 --> 00:22:51.010
<b>Because together it's not lonely, it's twoly.</b>

00:22:51.010 --> 00:22:56.140
<b>See, you're not alone any longer.</b>

00:22:57.280 --> 00:22:59.990
<b>Just because there's no one next to me</b>

00:22:59.990 --> 00:23:02.540
<b>doesn't mean that I'm lonely!</b>

00:23:02.540 --> 00:23:07.740
<b>For someone to notice this pain</b>

00:23:07.740 --> 00:23:13.270
<b>that heart must have surely cried.</b>

00:23:13.270 --> 00:23:16.650
<b>Right now, we'll crush to bits</b>

00:23:16.650 --> 00:23:20.350
<b>the fortress of our limitless sadness!</b>

00:23:20.350 --> 00:23:24.050
<b>I'll take you with me!</b>

00:23:24.050 --> 00:23:27.730
<b>Got it? I'm running through at full power.</b>

00:23:27.730 --> 00:23:31.470
<b>To where you're waiting, left behind</b>

00:23:31.470 --> 00:23:34.640
<b>in the place of tears...</b>

00:23:35.950 --> 00:23:39.770
<b>I believe in you, with burning passion!</b>

00:23:39.770 --> 00:23:43.560
<b>Come to me!</b>

00:23:51.010 --> 00:23:52.740
On the next Heroman:

00:23:52.740 --> 00:23:54.450
Heroman, you can't!

00:23:54.650 --> 00:23:56.200
If you let yourself be taken over by hatred...

00:23:56.740 --> 00:23:59.790
Joey is injured, and falls 
before Kogorr's fierce attack.

00:23:59.790 --> 00:24:03.960
Heroman seeing Joey in such a 
state shows an unexpected power.

00:24:04.480 --> 00:24:08.240
Power uncalled for... An evil 
energy clashes within him...

00:24:08.530 --> 00:24:11.600
And so, the battle heads to its conclusion.

00:24:12.340 --> 00:24:15.830
Next time on Heroman #9: Alive.

00:24:16.250 --> 00:24:18.720
Heroman... Attack!
